# An untrusted certificate and a ban end the link for good. An explicit
# connect afterwards still dials, with the failure count reset.
= tls on
! connect
> dial #1 irc.test:6667 tls
? notice Connecting to irc.test:6667
! closed bad-certificate 00112233445566778899aabbccddeeff00112233445566778899aabbccddeeff
? notice Disconnected: the server's certificate is not trusted
? offline bad-certificate
? next-wake none
? desired online
! connect
> dial #2 irc.test:6667 tls
? notice Connecting to irc.test:6667
? failures 0
! opened
> CAP LS 302
> NICK textual
> USER textual 0 * Textual
< :irc.test 465 textual :You are banned from this server (K-lined)
> hangup #2
? notice Disconnected: banned: You are banned from this server (K-lined)
? offline banned
